B.ZF=s(["Understand","Care","Products","Studio","Me","Lumi\xe8re\u2019s five connected worlds","Your personal beauty universe","For you today","A considered selection based on what you chose and saved.","From your Beauty Shelf","Continue a saved look","Try a look","Your product world","Know what has a role, what overlaps, and what can wait.","Beauty Shelf","A visual home for what you use, consider, finish, and choose against.","Why Lumi\xe8re picked this","Each suggestion must connect to your confirmed context, routine, or preference.","Check whether a category adds something new before considering another product.","See why each step exists and what currently fills it.","Using now","Recommended for you","Want to try","Finished","Not for me","Nothing here yet","Your choices will appear here when you add them.","Moisture","Conditioning","Nail color","Cleanser","Styling","Demo moisture veil","Demo softness conditioner","Demo sheer rose","Demo gentle cleanser","Demo styling cream","Fills the moisturizing role in your chosen morning routine.","Relates to your confirmed preference for softness and manageability.","Connects with a nail color you chose to explore.","Kept as personal history because you marked it finished.","Excluded because you chose not to see this type again.","Morning \xb7 moisture step","Wash day \xb7 conditioning step","Evening \xb7 cleansing step","Routine fit","A controlled category example with personal reasoning, never a live product listing.","Analysis and commercial relationships remain separate. No retailer or affiliate partner is connected.","Fictional device-demo catalogue only. No live prices, stock, ratings, claims, retailers, or affiliate relationships.","Not enough verified product information","Choose an item first. Lumi\xe8re will not guess whether an unidentified product is useful.","Lumi\xe8re Studio","Explore makeup, hair, nails, and color as one coordinated beauty language.","Makeup Studio","Explore complete looks, lips, eyes, cheeks, and intensity without changing your identity.","Explore movement, texture, color, and shape without presenting a generated image as real.","Nail Studio","Explore color, finish, shape, and design with no nail-health claims.","Create My Look","Coordinate makeup, hair, and nails around your context and preferences.","Signature experience","What are you getting ready for?","My Colors","Colors you may enjoy exploring across makeup, hair, nails, and saved looks.","Saved Looks","Your complete looks, elements, and palettes in one personal library.","No saved looks yet","Explore Studio and save a direction you want to revisit.","Explore Studio","Everyday","Work","Dinner","Party","Wedding guest","Vacation","Date night","Special event","Surprise me","Surprise me","No exact direction yet","Choose another context or let Lumi\xe8re show a curated alternative.","CURATED DEVICE-DEMO DIRECTION","Soft evening","Polished for work","Everyday light","Muted rose lip","A soft lip direction with adjustable intensity.","Soft movement","Loose movement that preserves your natural identity.","Sheer nail finish","A translucent rose direction with restrained shine.","Soft definition","Balanced definition without reshaping or correction claims.","Low polished style","A controlled silhouette with natural movement.","Warm cheek","A warm color direction to explore, not a prescription.","Quiet neutral nail","A subtle neutral finish for everyday exploration.","Soft earth","Warm, muted colors to explore across your saved directions.","Soft eye definition","A muted eye direction with restrained intensity.","Luminous complexion styling","A light-reflective styling direction without correction claims.","Rich brown color","A dimensional brown direction to explore, never a prediction of outcome.","Soft almond shape","A softly tapered shape direction for visual exploration.","Fine line detail","A minimal line design that can be removed from the look.","Cool evening","Deeper cool colors for optional evening exploration.","Color swatch","Save palette","Saved","Save look","Favorite","Add favorite","Beauty","Try asking","Does this product add anything to my routine?","Show me something softer for tonight.","What was the color I saved?","This illustrative guidance connects only the product, look, and preference context you selected.","Review the selected context, then choose whether to save, adjust, or leave it.","Recent","Favorites","Makeup","Hair","Nails","Intensity","Soft","Defined","Expressive","This experience is not connected yet.","Production Studio remains unavailable until its provider, privacy, identity-safety, and deletion gates pass.","Look saved","You saved a coordinated beauty direction around this time. No measured change is attributed to it.","Product choice updated","You moved a product into your personal Shelf. Lumi\xe8re does not claim it caused a result.","Curated fixtures only. No image generation, identity editing, live provider, or Beauty Memory write occurs."],t.s)
